  .brand-values-title {\n      font-size: 14px;\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\n    }\n    .brand-values-container {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 40px;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .brand-values-content {\n      padding-right: 0;\n    }\n    .value-item {\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"brand-values-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"brand-values-title\">\n    Brand <span class=\"highlight\">Values<\/span>\n  <\/h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"brand-values-container\">\n    <div class=\"brand-values-content\">\n      <div class=\"value-item\">\n        <div class=\"value-icon\">\n          <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/4833\/3323\/files\/Namnlos_design_42_5e6fddfb-529a-4fbb-a069-fbe5197be6e8.svg?v=1766148627\" alt=\"Check icon\">\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"value-text\">\n          <h3>SIMPLICITY<\/h3>\n          <p>We believe great care shouldn't be complicated. If it doesn't work in real life, we don't sell it.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"value-item\">\n        <div class=\"value-icon\">\n          <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/4833\/3323\/files\/Namnlos_design_42_5e6fddfb-529a-4fbb-a069-fbe5197be6e8.svg?v=1766148627\" alt=\"Check icon\">\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"value-text\">\n          <h3>LOVE<\/h3>\n          <p>Everything we create is driven by love for dogs - and the owners who care for them. Their health and happiness come first<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"value-item\">\n        <div class=\"value-icon\">\n          <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/4833\/3323\/files\/Namnlos_design_42_5e6fddfb-529a-4fbb-a069-fbe5197be6e8.svg?v=1766148627\" alt=\"Check icon\">\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"value-text\">\n          <h3>OWNERSHIP<\/h3>\n          <p>We take full responsibility for our products and our mistakes. When something's not right, we fix it.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"value-item\">\n        <div class=\"value-icon\">\n          <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/4833\/3323\/files\/Namnlos_design_42_5e6fddfb-529a-4fbb-a069-fbe5197be6e8.svg?v=1766148627\" alt=\"Check icon\">\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"value-text\">\n          <h3>TRANSFORMATION<\/h3>\n          <p>We're never satisfied with \"good enough.\" We constantly improve our products, our service, and ourselves.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <div class=\"brand-values-image\">\n      <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0735\/4833\/3323\/files\/Din_Hunds_Leende_spelar_ocksa_roll_76.png?v=1766048843\" alt=\"Happy Dalmatian\" loading=\"lazy\">\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"custom_liquid_6PfXCF":{"type":"custom-liquid","name":"t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","custom_liquid":"<style>\n  .testimonials-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 60px 20px 20px 20px;\n    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading h2 {\n    font-size: 35px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n    color: #000000;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading .gradient-text {\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #47B5E9 0%, #19B6B5 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n    background-clip: text;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading p {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #000000;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading .rating {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #000000;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading .rating .stars {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 2px;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading .rating .star {\n    color: #FFD700 !important;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading .rating .star-empty {\n    color: #E0E0E0 !important;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n  \n  .testimonials-heading .rating strong {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  \n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .testimonials-heading h2 {\n      font-size: 32px;\n    }\n  }\n<\/style>\n\n<div class=\"testimonials-heading\">\n  <h2>We let our customers <span class=\"gradient-text\">speak for themselves<\/span><\/h2>\n  <p>Real dog owners. Real results. Real stories of simple care that changed everything.<\/p>\n  <div class=\"rating\">\n    <span class=\"stars\">\n      <span class=\"star\">★<\/span><span class=\"star\">★<\/span><span class=\"star\">★<\/span><span class=\"star\">★<\/span><span class=\"star-empty\">★<\/span>\n    <\/span>\n    Excellent <strong>4.86<\/strong>\/5 based on <strong>2,500+<\/strong> customer reviews\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>","color_scheme":"background-1","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"testimonials_cQVkm9":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"column_PrdqpY":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"His breath is noticeably fresher after just a few days.","text":"<p>I’ve tried brushing before, but my dog hated it. These wipes are quick, gentle, and easy to use every day.<\/p>","author":"Lena K."}},"column_HBJUwt":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"No more struggle during dental care","text":"<p>My dog actually lets me clean his teeth now. It takes less than a minute and doesn’t stress him at all.<\/p>","author":"Oscar J."}},"column_jfGQW7":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"I was skeptical — but the results surprised me.","text":"<p>After a couple of weeks, his teeth look cleaner and his breath is much better. It feels safe to use daily.<\/p>","author":"Sofie N."}},"column_VGXk9t":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"So much easier than brushing","text":"<p>I wanted something simple that actually works. These wipes fit easily on my finger and feel gentle.<\/p>","author":"Ingrid T."}},"column_PTY7dj":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"So Easy Daily","text":"<p>I wanted something simple I could actually keep up with. These wipes take less than a minute and fit perfectly into our daily routine.<\/p>","author":"Karin L."}},"column_AEHQKQ":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"Feels Safe","text":"<p>It feels good knowing I’m doing something positive for my dog’s health without stressing him or myself.<\/p>","author":"Karin M."}},"column_zd46xU":{"type":"column","settings":{"star_rating":5,"title":"Worth It","text":"<p>I was unsure at first, but after a couple of weeks I can clearly see a difference. I’ll keep using them.<\/p>","author":"Sophia E."}}},"block_order":["column_PrdqpY","column_HBJUwt","column_jfGQW7","column_VGXk9t","column_PTY7dj","column_AEHQKQ","column_zd46xU"],"custom_css":[],"name":"Testimonials","settings":{"display_id":false,"visibility":"always-display","title":"","title_highlight_color":"#47b5e9","heading_size":"h1","text":"","color_scheme":"background-1","image_width":"full","image_ratio":"square","column_alignment":"center","show_stars":true,"inactive_stars_style":"solid","star_color":"#ffcc00","bg_star_color":"#ffffff","show_quotes":false,"quotes_color_scheme":"accent-2","cards_color_scheme":"custom","type":"slide","autoplay":false,"autoplay_speed":5,"arrows_color_scheme":"inverse","transparent_arrows":false,"dots_color_scheme":"inverse","desktop_full_page":true,"columns_desktop":3,"slider_desktop":true,"per_move_desktop":3,"desktop_spacing":40,"desktop_side_padding":0,"desktop_padding_calc":true,"desktop_adaptive_height":false,"desktop_dots_position":"under","desktop_arrows_position":"under","slider_mobile":true,"enable_mobile_preview":false,"mobile_adaptive_height":false,"mobile_dots_position":"under","mobile_arrows_position":"under","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36,"custom_col